{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25806","headline":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 翡翠坞 · 李绅","name":"过梅里七首  家於无锡四十载今敝庐数堵犹存今列题於後 翡翠坞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翡翠飞飞绕莲坞，一啄嘉鱼一鸣舞。\n莲茎触散莲叶欹，露滴珠光似还浦。\n虞人掠水轻浮弋，翡翠惊飞飞不息。\n直上层空翠影高，还向云间双比翼。\n弹射莫及弋不得，日暮虞人空叹息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}